Table full name: isb-cgc-bq.pancancer_atlas.Filtered_MC3_MAF_V5_one_per_tumor_sample
Column name: ParticipantBarcode Type: STRING Description: TCGA barcode identifier for the study participant, eg TCGA-02-0001
Column name: Tumor_SampleBarcode Type: STRING Description: Original TCGA tumor sample barcode.TCGA-WC-A885-01A, TCGA-HQ-A2OF-01A.
Column name: Tumor_AliquotBarcode Type: STRING Description: Original TCGA tumor aliquote barcode. Examples: TCGA-WC-A885-01A,TCGA-XF-AAN3-01A
Column name: Normal_SampleBarcode Type: STRING Description: Sample Barcode For The Normal Tissue. Examples: TCGA-V4-A9EI-10A, TCGA-V4-A9EI-10A
Column name: Normal_AliquotBarcode Type: STRING Description: Aliquot Barcode For The Normal Tissue. Examples: TCGA-CR-7385-10A-01D-2013-08, TCGA-DX-A3M1-10A-01D-A22A-09
Column name: Normal_SampleTypeLetterCode Type: STRING Description: Sample Type Letter Code. The subset of 4 values currently used are: NBC, NB, NT, NBM. See https://Gdc.Cancer.Gov/Resources-Tcga-Users/Tcga-Code-Tables/Sample-Type-Codes
Column name: Study Type: STRING Description: TCGA study abbreviation, eg LAML. Full list available at https://gdc.cancer.gov/resources-tcga-users/tcga-code-tables/tcga-study-abbreviations
Column name: Hugo_Symbol Type: STRING Description: HUGO symbol for the gene (HUGO symbols are always in all caps). "Unknown" is used for regions that do not correspond to a gene
Column name: HGVSp_Short Type: STRING Description: Protein sequence of the variant in HGVS recommended format, but using 1-letter amino-acid codes. "p.=" signifies no change in the protein
Column name: Variant_Classification Type: STRING Description: Translational effect of variant allele; eg. Missense_Mutation, Nonsense_Mutation, etc.
Column name: HGVSc Type: STRING Description: The coding sequence of the variant in HGVS recommended format
Column name: CENTERS Type: STRING Description: One or more genome sequencing center reporting the variant
Column name: FILTER Type: STRING Description: List of failed filters (if any), or "PASS" indicating the variant has passed all filters.
