Table full name: isb-cgc-bq.pancancer_atlas.Filtered_clinical_PANCAN_patient_with_followup
Column name: bcr_patient_uuid Type: STRING Description: Patient universally unique identifier, eg 180A2B9C-9CAC-4D96-86E8-CD6B3B9386B5
Column name: bcr_patient_barcode Type: STRING Description: TCGA barcode identifier for the study participant, eg TCGA-02-0001
Column name: acronym Type: STRING Description: TCGA study abbreviation, eg LAML. Full list available at https://gdc.cancer.gov/resources-tcga-users/tcga-code-tables/tcga-study-abbreviations
Column name: gender Type: STRING Description: Participant gender; eg. MALE, FEMALE
Column name: vital_status Type: STRING Description: The latest updated vital status from follow-up data, eg Alive, Dead, [Discrepancy], NULL
Column name: days_to_birth Type: FLOAT64 Description: Days since birth (a negative value, relative to the date of diagnosis which is considered to be t=0)
Column name: days_to_death Type: STRING Description: If vital_status indicates 'dead', then this is the number of days to death (a positive value) relative to the date of diagnosis.
Column name: days_to_last_followup Type: STRING Description: If vital_status indicates 'alive', then this is the number of days from the date of diagnosis to the last followup (communication contact).
Column name: days_to_initial_pathologic_diagnosis Type: INT64 Description: The number of days to initial pathologic diagnosis
Column name: age_at_initial_pathologic_diagnosis Type: INT64 Description: Age, in years, at which a condition or disease was first diagnosed
Column name: icd_10 Type: STRING Description: Alphanumeric value used to describe the disease code from the tenth version of the International Classification of Disease (ICD-10). Examples: C01, C55, C40.3
Column name: tissue_retrospective_collection_indicator Type: STRING Description: Text indicator for the time frame of tissue procurement, indicating that the tissue was obtained and stored prior to the initiation of the project. Takes YES, NO, NULL, and [Discrepancy] values.
Column name: icd_o_3_histology Type: STRING Description: Code that represents the histology of the disease using the third edition of the International Classification of Diseases for Oncology, published in 2000, used principally in tumor and cancer registries for coding the site (topography) and the histology (morphology) of neoplasms
Column name: tissue_prospective_collection_indicator Type: STRING Description: Text indicator for the time frame of tissue procurement, indicating that the tissue was procured in parallel to the project. Takes YES, NO, NULL, and [Discrepancy] values.
Column name: history_of_neoadjuvant_treatment Type: STRING Description: Possible values: Yes, No,Yes - Pharmaceutical Treatmet Prior to Resection, Yes - Radiation Prior to Resection(also can be blank)
Column name: icd_o_3_site Type: STRING Description: Code that represents the site of the disease using the third edition of the International Classification of Diseases for Oncology, published in 2000, used principally in tumor and cancer registries for coding the site (topography) and the histology (morphology) of neoplasms. Examples:C01.9, C20.9, C32.1
Column name: tumor_tissue_site Type: STRING Description: Category describing current smoking status and smoking history as self-reported by a participant.; eg. 1, 2, etc.
Column name: new_tumor_event_after_initial_treatment Type: STRING Description: Indicates whether a patient has had a new tumor event after initial treatment; Yes, No
Column name: radiation_therapy Type: STRING Description: Indicates whether a patient has had radiation therapy; YES, NO, NULL, [Unknown], and [Discrepancy]
Column name: race Type: STRING Description: The race of a participant, independent from ethnicity; eg. White, Black or African American, Asian, Native Hawaiian or other Pacific Islander, American Indian or Alaska Native
Column name: project_code Type: STRING Description: Project code; TCGA or NULL
Column name: prior_dx Type: STRING Description: Indicator and type of prior diagnosis; eg. No; Yes, History of Prior Malignancy; Yes, History of Synchronous/Bilateral Malignancy; Both History of Synchronous/Bilateral and Prior Malignancy, [Discrepancy], and NULL
Column name: disease_code Type: STRING Description: A code representing the type of cancer. Values can be found at https://gdc.cancer.gov/resources-tcga-users/tcga-code-tables/tcga-study-abbreviations; eg. OV, GBM, LUAD
Column name: ethnicity Type: STRING Description: The ethnic origination of a participant, independent from race; eg. Not Hispanic or Latino, Hispanic or Latino
Column name: informed_consent_verified Type: STRING Description: Indicates whether informed consent is verified; YES
Column name: person_neoplasm_cancer_status Type: STRING Description: The participant's cancer status; Either WITH TUMOR or TUMOR FREE, [Unknown], [Discrepancy], and NULL
Column name: patient_id Type: STRING Description: Participant ID; eg. AA2W, AA2T
Column name: year_of_initial_pathologic_diagnosis Type: INT64 Description: Four digit year of the initial pathologic diagnosis
Column name: histological_type Type: STRING Description: The histological type of cancer; eg. Adenosquamous, Astrocytoma, etc.
Column name: tissue_source_site Type: STRING Description: Tissue Source Site Codes; eg. FF, 4G. Full list available at https://gdc.cancer.gov/resources-tcga-users/tcga-code-tables/tissue-source-site-codes
Column name: form_completion_date Type: STRING Description: Form completion date; eg. 2013-12-23
Column name: pathologic_T Type: STRING Description: The pathologic T score is a rating of the extent of the primary tumor, based on surgery or biopsy; eg. T1, T2, T3, T4
Column name: pathologic_M Type: STRING Description: The pathologic M score is a rating of metastasis, that is, how much cancer has spread to distant sites. It is based on surgery or biopsy; eg. MX, M0, M1
Column name: clinical_M Type: STRING Description: The clinical M score is a rating of metastasis, that is, how much cancer has spread to distant sites. It is based on results of tests done before surgery, such as physical exams and imaging scans; eg. MX, M0, M1
Column name: pathologic_N Type: STRING Description: The pathologic N score is a rating of the extent of cancer within nearby lymph nodes, based on surgery or biopsy; eg. N1, N2, N3
Column name: system_version Type: STRING Description: System version; eg. 2009, 4th
Column name: pathologic_stage Type: STRING Description: The stage of the cancer, based on surgery or biopsy; eg. Stage II, Stage III, Stage IV, Stage IVA, Stage IIIB, Stage IIIS, Stage IIIC
Column name: stage_other Type: STRING Description: Other stages of cancer; this field is NULL for all rows
Column name: clinical_stage Type: STRING Description: The stage of the cancer, based on results of tests done before surgery, such as physical exams and imaging scans; eg. Stage I, Stage II, Stage III, Stage IV
Column name: clinical_T Type: STRING Description: The clinical T score is a rating of the extent of the primary tumor, based on results of tests done before surgery, such as physical exams and imaging scans; eg. T1, T2, T3, T4
Column name: clinical_N Type: STRING Description: The clinical N score is a rating of the extent of cancer within nearby lymph nodes, based on results of tests done before surgery, such as physical exams and imaging scans; eg. N1, N2, N3
Column name: extranodal_involvement Type: STRING Description: Indicator that identifies whether a patient with malignant lymphoma has lymphomatous involvement of an extranodal site. YES, NO, [Not Applicable], and NULL
Column name: postoperative_rx_tx Type: STRING Description: YES, NO, [Discrepancy], and [Unknown] indicator of post operative residual tumor
Column name: primary_therapy_outcome_success Type: STRING Description: Kind of outcome achieved after the completion of the initial course of treatment; eg. Complete Remission/Response, Progressive Disease, Stable Disease, Partial Remission/Response, Persistent Diseaase, etc.
Column name: lymph_node_examined_count Type: STRING Description: The number of lymph nodes examined. Some records contains [Not Applicable].
Column name: primary_lymph_node_presentation_assessment Type: STRING Description: YES, NO, [Discrepancy], and [Unknown] indicator of primary lymph node presentation assessment
Column name: initial_pathologic_diagnosis_method Type: STRING Description: Text that describe the initial pathologic diagnosis method, eg. Tumor resection, Excisional Biopsy, Dilation and curettage procedure, etc
Column name: number_of_lymphnodes_positive_by_he Type: STRING Description: The number of lymph nodes involved with disease as determined by histological examination
Column name: eastern_cancer_oncology_group Type: STRING Description: Eastern cancer oncology group performance status. Integer number between 0 and 5.
Column name: anatomic_neoplasm_subdivision Type: STRING Description: The spatial location, subdivisions and/or atomic site name of a tumor; eg. Rectum, Larynx, Tonsil, etc.
Column name: residual_tumor Type: STRING Description: Status of the tissue margin following surgical resection; eg. R0, R1, R2, RX
Column name: histological_type_other Type: STRING Description: Additional histological types of cancer; eg. Diffuse sclerosing variant, Ductal/Cribiform, etc.
Column name: init_pathology_dx_method_other Type: STRING Description: Additional initial pathologic diagnosis methods, eg. Biopsy and endocervical curettage, Cervical biopsies and cystoscopy, etc.
Column name: karnofsky_performance_score Type: STRING Description: Karnofsky performance score. Describe the classification used of the functional capabilities of a person, values can be 0, 10, 20, ... , 100, [Not Evaluated], or [Unknown].
Column name: neoplasm_histologic_grade Type: STRING Description: Rating which expresses the degree of abnormality of cancer cells, a measure of differentiation and aggressiveness; eg. G1, G2, G3, G4, GX, High Grage, GB, Low Grade
Column name: height Type: STRING Description: Height of participant in centimeters
Column name: weight Type: STRING Description: Weight of participant in kilograms
Column name: history_of_radiation_metastatic_site Type: STRING Description: History of radiation metastatic site
Column name: days_to_patient_progression_free Type: STRING Description: Number of days between the date used for index and the date the patient's disease was formally confirmed as progression-free. Null for all participants.
Column name: days_to_first_response Type: STRING Description: Number of days between the date used for index and the date of the patient first response to their disease. Null for all participants.
Column name: days_to_first_partial_response Type: STRING Description: Number of days between the date used for index and the date the patient's disease was first confirmed as partial response. Null for all participants.
Column name: days_to_first_complete_response Type: STRING Description: Number of days between the date used for index and the date the patient's disease was first confirmed as compete response. Null for all participants.
Column name: days_to_tumor_progression Type: STRING Description: Number of days between the date used for index and the date the patient's disease progressed. Null for all participants.
Column name: er_estimated_duration_response Type: STRING Description: Estimated duration response for ER positive tumors. Null for all participants.
Column name: er_disease_extent_prior_er_treatment Type: STRING Description: Disease extent prior to ER treatment. Null for all participants.
Column name: er_solid_tumor_response_documented_type Type: STRING Description: Solid tumor response type for ER positive tumors. Null for all participants.
Column name: er_solid_tumor_response_documented_type_other Type: STRING Description: Additional solid tumor response types for ER positive tumors. Null for all participants.
Column name: er_response_type Type: STRING Description: Response type for ER positive tumors. Null for all participants.
Column name: history_of_radiation_primary_site Type: STRING Description: History of radiation in the primary site. Null for all participants.
Column name: history_prior_surgery_type Type: STRING Description: History prior surgery type. Null for all participants.
Column name: patient_progression_status Type: STRING Description: Patient progression status. Null for all participants.
Column name: history_prior_surgery_type_other Type: STRING Description: Additional history prior surgery types. Null for all participants.
Column name: history_prior_surgery_indicator Type: STRING Description: Indicator of history prior surgery. Null for all participants.
Column name: field Type: STRING Description: Field. Null for all participants.
Column name: molecular_abnormality_results_other Type: STRING Description: Additional molecular abnormality results. Null for all participants.
Column name: molecular_abnormality_results Type: STRING Description: Molecular abnormality results. Null for all participants.
Column name: number_of_lymphnodes_positive_by_ihc Type: STRING Description: Number of lymph nodes-positive determined by immunohistochemistry
Column name: tobacco_smoking_history Type: STRING Description: Description of tobacco skmoking history, eg. Lifelong Non-smoker, Current Reformed Smoker, Duration Not Specified, etc.
Column name: number_pack_years_smoked Type: STRING Description: A measurement of the amount of smoking exposure an individual has had over time, which is calculated by multiplying the number of cigarettes smoked per day by the number of years smoked, and dividing the product by the number of cigarettes in a pack.
Column name: stopped_smoking_year Type: STRING Description: Four digit stopped smoking year
Column name: performance_status_scale_timing Type: STRING Description: Performance status. Takes values of Post-Adjuvant Therapy, Pre-Adjuvant Therapy, Pre-Operative, Preoperative, Post Adjuvant Therapy, Post Secondary Therapy, or Other
Column name: laterality Type: STRING Description: Text term that represents the side of the body on which the tumor or cancer developed.
Column name: targeted_molecular_therapy Type: STRING Description: The yes/no indicator related to prior administration of cancer therapies designed to act upon specific molecules in metabolic pathways or processes involved in carcinogenesis, tumor growth, or tumor spread. NCI CDE: 3440083
Column name: year_of_tobacco_smoking_onset Type: STRING Description: The year in which the participant began smoking.
Column name: anatomic_neoplasm_subdivision_other Type: STRING Description: Additional spatial location, subdivisions and/or atomic site name of a tumor.
Column name: patient_death_reason Type: STRING Description: the primary cause of death. NCI CDE: 25
Column name: tumor_tissue_site_other Type: STRING Description: Text term that describes another anatomic site location not previously mentioned for the peritumoral tissue. NCI CDE: 5118531
Column name: menopause_status Type: STRING Description: The response that describes the menopausal status of a patient (a condition or state relating to the permanent cessation of menses).
Column name: age_began_smoking_in_years Type: STRING Description: Age began smoking cigarettes expressed in number of years since birth. NCI CDE: 2178045
Column name: margin_status Type: STRING Description: The indication of whether there has been cancer involvement in the surgical margin after tissue removal. NCI CDE: 7038796
Column name: kras_gene_analysis_performed Type: STRING Description: Indicator of whether or not analysis for KRAS gene mutation abnormality was performed. NCI CDE: 6060079
Column name: kras_mutation_found Type: STRING Description: kras mutation present
Column name: death_cause_text Type: STRING Description: The text that describes the cause of death. NCI CDE: 2179658
Column name: lactate_dehydrogenase_result Type: STRING Description: Text term to represent the summary result of the medical procedure that involves testing a sample of blood for lactate dehydrogenase (LDH), to help determine a diagnosis, plan treatment, check to see if treatment is working, or monitor the disease over time. NCI CDE: 3113468
Column name: days_to_sample_procurement Type: STRING Description: Days to sample procurement.
Column name: hbv_test Type: STRING Description: Hepatitis B virus (HBV) test
Column name: on_haart_therapy_at_cancer_diagnosis Type: STRING Description: Text term to signify the administration of highly active antiretroviral therapy (HAART) at the time of cancer diagnosis NCI CDE: 2922679
Column name: hcv_test Type: STRING Description: The indicator that describes whether or not HCV was performed
Column name: prior_aids_conditions Type: STRING Description: Prior AIDS condition.
