Column name: kshv_hhv8_test Type: STRING Description: Text indicator to respresent whether a serological herpes human virus 8 (HHV8) test was completed for an individual. NCI CDE: 3335774
Column name: days_to_hiv_diagnosis Type: STRING Description: Time interval from the date of the initial pathologic diagnosis to the date of human immunodeficiency diagnosis, represented as a calculated number of days. NCI CDE: 4618491
Column name: hiv_status Type: STRING Description: the result of a test to detect the presence of human immunodeficiency virus antibody in a patient. NCI CDE: 2180464
Column name: hiv_rna_load_at_diagnosis Type: STRING Description: Number to represent the numeric value for a human immunodeficiency virus viral load (the number of HIV viral particles in a sample of blood plasma) assay performed on an individual at the time of diagnosis. NCI CDE: 2922674
Column name: cdc_hiv_risk_group Type: STRING Description: The patient risk group category for the Human Immunodeficiency Virus (HIV). NCI CDE: 2542215
Column name: history_of_other_malignancy Type: STRING Description: Clinical history of other malignancy.
Column name: history_immunosuppresive_dx Type: STRING Description: Clinical history of immunosuppresive diagnosis.
Column name: nadir_cd4_counts Type: STRING Description: A patient's nadir cd4 count.
Column name: history_relevant_infectious_dx_other Type: STRING Description: History of other relevant infectious diagnosis
Column name: history_relevant_infectious_dx Type: STRING Description: History of relevant infectious diagnosis
Column name: cd4_counts_at_diagnosis Type: STRING Description: Cd4 counts at diagnosis
Column name: history_immunological_disease_other Type: STRING Description: History of other immunological disease.
Column name: hpv_test Type: STRING Description: The name of the procedure performed to describe the papillomavirus strain being tested. NCI CDE: 6028407
Column name: history_immunosuppressive_dx_other Type: STRING Description: Clinical history of other immunosuppresive diagnosis.
Column name: history_immunological_disease Type: STRING Description: History of immunological disease.
Column name: lost_follow_up Type: STRING Description: The yes/no/unknown indicator used to describe whether a patient was unable to be contacted or seen for follow-up information. NCI CDE: 6161018
Column name: venous_invasion Type: STRING Description: The indication of whether or not there has been extramural invasion of the veins by malignant cells. NCI CDE: 7038780
Column name: lymphatic_invasion Type: STRING Description: The indication of whether or not malignant cells are present within lymphatic vessels. NCI CDE: 7038779
