Column name: her2_immunohistochemistry_level_result Type: STRING Description: The gene that controls cell growth by making the human epidermal growth factor receptor 2, detected by immunohistochemical means and expressed as 0 through 4+. NCI CDE: 2178402
Column name: breast_carcinoma_immunohistochemistry_pos_cell_score Type: STRING Description: The score assigned to a breast carcinoma sample on the basis of immunohistochemistry analysis. NCI CDE: 3133874
Column name: distant_metastasis_present_ind2 Type: STRING Description: The yes/no indicator whether distant metastases are present.
Column name: her2_erbb_pos_finding_fluorescence_in_situ_hybridization_calculation_method_text Type: STRING Description: Text to describe the method used to calculate HER2/ERBB2 Fluorescence in situ Hybridization (FISH) positivity in a specimen or sample. NCI CDE: 3087929
Column name: breast_carcinoma_immunohistochemistry_progesterone_receptor_pos_finding_scale Type: STRING Description: Text term to specify the immunohistochemistry intensity scale used for a positive finding for progesterone receptor in breast cancer tumor. NCI CDE: 3203083
Column name: breast_carcinoma_primary_surgical_procedure_name Type: STRING Description: Text name of a surgical procedure performed for a person with a diagnosis of breast cancer. [Manually-curated]
Column name: er_level_cell_percentage_category Type: STRING Description: Classification to represent ER Positive results expressed as a percentage value. NCI CDE: 3128341
Column name: breast_carcinoma_progesterone_receptor_status Type: STRING Description: The progesterone receptor status of a primary breast tumor or metastases. NCI CDE: 6117728
Column name: breast_carcinoma_surgical_procedure_name Type: STRING Description: Text name of a surgical procedure performed for a person with a diagnosis of breast cancer. [Manually-curated] NCI CDE: 2739580
Column name: breast_neoplasm_other_surgical_procedure_descriptive_text Type: STRING Description: Text to describe a surgical procedure performed for a malignant neoplasm of the breast that is different from previously identified options. NCI CDE: 3124493
Column name: er_detection_method_text Type: STRING Description: The free-text field to capture the method of measurement used to detect the status of the estrogen receptor. e.g., dextran coated charcoal. NCI CDE: 69
