Column name: metastatic_breast_carcinoma_progesterone_receptor_level_cell_percent_category Type: STRING Description: Classification to represent metastatic breast carcinoma Progesterone Receptor (PR) positive results expressed as a percentage value. NCI CDE: 3131891
