Column name: axillary_lymph_node_stage_other_method_descriptive_text Type: STRING Description: Text to describe a technique of staging (assessing the extent of a cancer within the body) from the area of the armpit/axilla that is different from the options previously identified. NCI CDE: 3124496
Column name: metastatic_breast_carcinoma_progesterone_receptor_status Type: STRING Description: Text term to represent the overall result of metastatic breast carcinoma Progresterone Receptor (PR) testing. NCI CDE: 3131884
